          %p
            (See
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoid+object+in+an+%28infinity%2C1%29-category"} groupoid object in an (infinity,1)-category
            for more details on this Quillen equivalence.)
          %h3#for_parameterized_groupoids_stacks__sheaves
            For parameterized
            = succeed "-groupoids" do
