                  %mrow
                    %mi k
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/delooping"} delooping
            provides a correspondence between
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-category"} n-categories
            that have trivial
            = succeed "s" do
